body:
Actually, this isn't about default mappings, it is a problem with fields of type `ip`.  This request will replicate the same problem:

```
PUT my_index
{
  "mappings": {
    "one": {
      "properties": {
        "field": {
          "type": "ip"
        }
      }
    },
    "two": {
      "properties": {
        "field": {
          "type": "ip"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
